docs {
  # Create Booking - Hotel Accommodation

  Creates an accommodation booking for Park Hyatt Tokyo.

  **NEW API**: Trip day is automatically created if it doesn't exist for the date.

  ## Required Fields
  - `trip_id`: ID of the trip (trip day is auto-created)
  - `event_date`: Date of the booking event (YYYY-MM-DD format)
  - `name`: Booking name

  ## Booking Details
  - **Type**: Accommodation (hotel)
  - **Provider**: Hyatt Hotels Corporation
  - **Check-in**: 3:00 PM, June 1, 2024
  - **Cost**: ¥45,000 per night (~$310 USD)
  - **Status**: Confirmed

  ## Hotel Information
  - **Name**: Park Hyatt Tokyo (パークハイアット東京)
  - **Location**: Shinjuku, Tokyo (floors 39-52 of Shinjuku Park Tower)
  - **Famous for**: Lost in Translation movie filming location
  - **Amenities**: Sky-high views, New York Grill restaurant, excellent service

  ## Confirmation Details
  - Confirmation #: PH2025010104
  - Booking Reference: HYATT-JP-001
  - Contact: +81-3-5322-1234

  ## Optional Fields
  - `activity_id`: Link to specific activity (if applicable)
  - `booking_date`, `booking_time`: When the booking was made
  - Various contact and location details

  ## Booking URL
  Direct link to manage reservation online
}
